cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite the Zenodo record below."
type: software
title: "ERK Conjecture 4.6: A proof of bistability at all processivity levels in a model of ERK regulation"
abstract: >-
  For each prescribed pair of kinase and phosphatase processivities in the open
  unit square, a single choice of thirteen positive rates and three positive
  totals supports two distinct positive equilibria, both exponentially stable on
  the same nine-dimensional stoichiometric class. The package contains the
  manuscript, a Lean 4 formalization of the main theorem, an exact SageMath
  certificate, and additional verification scripts.
